    "questions": [
      {
        "id": 14852,
        "quiz_id": 3530,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Some people think it is better for one single legal system throughout the world. Others say countries should have their own laws. Discuss both views and give your opinion.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J1zudtb6CoW1xNxRgg2lctezgvb\"><em><strong>Some people think it is better for one single legal system throughout the world. Others say countries should have their own laws. Discuss both views and give your opinion.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Global Legal System&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SM9XdTCTvor6KSxzeEVlFkZ7gUb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Global Legal System&nbsp;cho 2 quan điểm:</strong> Để giảm tội phạm, tốt hơn n&ecirc;n c&oacute; một hệ thống ph&aacute;p luật duy nhất tr&ecirc;n to&agrave;n thế giới<em> (Quan điểm 1)</em>, trong khi một số người kh&aacute;c cho rằng c&aacute;c quốc gia n&ecirc;n c&oacute; luật ph&aacute;p ri&ecirc;ng của họ<em> (Quan điểm 2)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BytldV9zZotS3ZxQ1Tylo7HrgTb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Thảo luận cả hai quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến của bạn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PvKzd6KuVotYU3xLsORlQHe8gsb\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Global Legal System&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vnsrdj9O7o0qQBxKIIHl3XjmgJd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnaNd1DMpoXUlJxQrwblScTTghe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UxTwdM0eSoFgFoxTUBdlcxYQgTb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QQESdhAlpoVAy2xNVDwl2UPBgEg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>universal legal framework <em>(khung luật chung to&agrave;n cầu)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iw2hdEksqo2iJExEzXClBJowgXc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>maintain (sở hữu) own laws <em>(duy tr&igrave; ph&aacute;p luật của ri&ecirc;ng)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JFZqd4w08o2eW0xRrdGl4ht8gBh\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm thứ 2, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>'mặc d&ugrave; việc c&oacute; khung luật ph&aacute;p thống nhất to&agrave;n cầu c&oacute; một số lợi &iacute;ch nhất định, nhưng c&aacute;c nước n&ecirc;n c&oacute; hệ thống ph&aacute;p luật ri&ecirc;ng để giải quyết c&aacute;c vấn đề trong nước một c&aacute;ch hiệu quả hơn'. </strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QMJkdupjmoUnkQxweailgKK8gLf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ đ&oacute;ng vai ng&ocirc;i thứ 3: b&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch mang lại bởi khung luật ph&aacute;p thống nhất to&agrave;n cầu.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HLXAdiVFaokE1txai3dlkjV5gQg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm của ri&ecirc;ng c&aacute; nh&acirc;n m&igrave;nh rằng c&aacute;c nước n&ecirc;n c&oacute; hệ thống ph&aacute;p luật ri&ecirc;ng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch mang lại bởi khung luật ph&aacute;p thống nhất to&agrave;n cầu.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZPpWdOQZhow4TixnAcll7cN9gZc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Việc thực hiện một hệ thống ph&aacute;p luật duy nhất tr&ecirc;n to&agrave;n thế giới sẽ <em>mang lại một số lợi &iacute;ch nhất định (yield several benefits)</em>.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IQ1AdZfWhojZhvxpDstl2bYwgRc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WsscdSx4xotIgUxU1WNluWqtgZe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Một hệ thống ph&aacute;p luật phổ qu&aacute;t sẽ <em>thiết lập ti&ecirc;u chuẩn b&igrave;nh đẳng (establish equality standards)</em> cho tất cả mọi người, ngăn chặn một số quốc gia ban h&agrave;nh luật <em>vi phạm quyền cơ bản của con người (basic human rights)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GuuqdA9ABoMYlWxstzAlSogpgFb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>V&iacute; dụ, một số quốc gia vẫn c&ograve;n những luật <em>cho ph&eacute;p ph&acirc;n biệt đối xử (allow discrimination)</em> dựa tr&ecirc;n giới t&iacute;nh hoặc t&ocirc;n gi&aacute;o, điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể bị cấm dưới <em>một hệ thống luật to&agrave;n cầu thống nhất (a unified global legal system)</em>, gi&uacute;p đảm bảo mọi người đều được bảo vệ bởi c&ugrave;ng một ti&ecirc;u chuẩn nh&acirc;n quyền, <em>bất kể (regardless of) </em>họ sinh sống ở đ&acirc;u tr&ecirc;n thế giới.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L6hPdRaq0oSc2qxJrxOlZqs4gwh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NGG4duDl8obB0GxMsy5lh8yUgMf\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: một hệ thống thống nhất sẽ l&agrave;m cho <em>việc truy tố tội phạm xuy&ecirc;n bi&ecirc;n giới&nbsp;</em>\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-E5aLdK5sbo3Py4xqHyxlLvIBgwA\"><em>(criminal prosecution across borders)</em> trở n&ecirc;n<em>&nbsp;</em><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">hiệu quả hơn</span></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MBNfduDSwoLTnCx9dkylKyGngAg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> C&aacute;c cơ quan thực thi ph&aacute;p luật c&oacute; thể dễ d&agrave;ng hơn trong việc <em>bắt giữ v&agrave; dẫn độ (apprehend and extradite)</em>&nbsp;những nghi phạm cố gắng <em>trốn tr&aacute;nh c&ocirc;ng l&yacute; (evade justice)</em>&nbsp;bằng c&aacute;ch chạy trốn sang c&aacute;c quốc gia kh&aacute;c, điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể g&oacute;p phần l&agrave;m giảm tỷ lệ tội phạm quốc tế.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm của ri&ecirc;ng c&aacute; nh&acirc;n m&igrave;nh rằng c&aacute;c nước n&ecirc;n c&oacute; hệ thống ph&aacute;p luật ri&ecirc;ng.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I95bdlb79oeLm1x4ot9lLiz1guf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng việc cho ph&eacute;p c&aacute;c quốc gia duy tr&igrave; hệ thống ph&aacute;p luật ri&ecirc;ng mang lại lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H1Fkd0vYhoUdgCxtd2bl8FZvgve\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mo8fdAKvsopKgExOrmqltFulggh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: hệ thống ph&aacute;p luật ri&ecirc;ng gi&uacute;p <em>phản &aacute;nh tốt hơn (better reflect)</em> c&aacute;c gi&aacute; trị văn h&oacute;a v&agrave; truyền thống của mỗi x&atilde; hội. C&aacute;c cộng đồng kh&aacute;c nhau c&oacute; c&aacute;c chuẩn mực đạo đức kh&aacute;c nhau, v&agrave; những bộ luật <em>ph&ugrave; hợp với chuẩn mực văn h&oacute;a địa phương (align with local cultural norms)</em> sẽ c&oacute; thể được c&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n t&ocirc;n trọng v&agrave; tu&acirc;n thủ hơn.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HzVTdywIbofJbPxP8z2lMu9Ygse\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>V&iacute; dụ, c&aacute;c bộ luật về gia đ&igrave;nh thường <em>bắt nguồn từ những niềm tin văn h&oacute;a s&acirc;u sắc (stem from deeply-rooted cultural beliefs)</em> v&agrave; c&oacute; sự kh&aacute;c biệt r&otilde; rệt giữa c&aacute;c x&atilde; hội phương Đ&ocirc;ng v&agrave; phương T&acirc;y</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LwQldSKqSopmEZxI4WBliF2ygGd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ExFSdg9YJoDgpUxkdF9lMKsCgwq\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: c&aacute;c hệ thống ph&aacute;p luật ri&ecirc;ng biệt gi&uacute;p nh&agrave; nước <em>phản ứng linh hoạt hơn với (have more flexible responses to)</em> những vấn đề địa phương, v&igrave; mỗi quốc gia đều <em>đối mặt với những th&aacute;ch thức đặc th&ugrave; (confront unique challenges)</em> cần <em>c&aacute;c giải ph&aacute;p ph&aacute;p l&yacute; ri&ecirc;ng biệt (specific legal solutions)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BpkUdXFusoA7FnxA8dAl5ey3gHe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:</strong> V&iacute; dụ, quy định về m&ocirc;i trường c&oacute; thể <em>được điều chỉnh cho ph&ugrave; hợp (be tailored to)</em> với hệ sinh th&aacute;i v&agrave; ng&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng nghiệp địa phương, l&agrave;m cho ch&uacute;ng trở n&ecirc;n hiệu quả hơn so với lại c&aacute;c bộ luật phổ qu&aacute;t <em>m&agrave; c&oacute; thể kh&ocirc;ng t&iacute;nh đến sự kh&aacute;c biệt khu vực (might not account for regional differences)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R5madANhMoRBHUx45LFlJKIUgLc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I33wdvt8foOZDsx5XhFlRtnxgzZ\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IIEOdnu1Jo0FyZxVRRhlRycSgre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>a single global legal system <em>(một hệ thống ph&aacute;p l&yacute; to&agrave;n c&acirc;u)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrBzdTs1Ko13hZxoHUUlDcZSgSd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">country-specific laws <em>(luật ph&aacute;p d&agrave;nh ri&ecirc;ng cho từng quốc gia)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 865,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WS5bdIQ5hoZKzDxcYyyl0w8Ug7O\">Opinions are divided on whether the world should adopt a single legal system or whether each nation should maintain its own laws. While some people advocate for a universal legal framework, others believe in preserving legal diversity across countries. In my opinion, although a unified legal system offers certain advantages, countries should retain their own laws to better address their unique circumstances.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14852,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 866,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E5aLdK5sbo3Py4xqHyxlLvIBgwA\"><strong>Admittedly, implementing a single legal system worldwide would yield several benefits.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">One major advantage is that a universal legal system would establish equality standards for everyone, preventing some countries from enacting laws that violate basic human rights. For example, some countries still have laws that allow discrimination based on gender or religion, which could be prohibited under a unified global legal system. This would help ensure that everyone is protected by the same human rights standards, regardless of where they live in the world.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, a unified system would make criminal prosecution across borders more efficient. Law enforcement agencies could more easily apprehend and extradite suspects who attempt to evade justice by fleeing to other countries, which would likely contribute to reducing international crime rates.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14852,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 867,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I99jdMiRnogbQCxYTSslJav8g9d\"><strong>However, I believe that allowing countries to maintain their own legal systems is more beneficial overall</strong>. <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Firstly, individual legal systems better reflect the cultural values and traditions of each society. Different communities have varying moral and ethical standards, and laws that align with local cultural norms are more likely to be respected and followed by citizens. For example, family law practices often stem from deeply-rooted cultural beliefs that differ significantly between Eastern and Western societies.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Secondly, separate legal systems enable more flexible responses to local issues. Each country confronts unique challenges that require specific legal solutions. Environmental regulations, for instance, can be tailored to local ecosystems and industries, making them more effective than universal laws that might not account for regional differences</span>.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14852,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 868,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OuxvdQJx0oRmbbx7ri2lELzyg6e\">In conclusion, while a single global legal system might offer advantages in terms of human rights protection and cross-border crime fighting, I believe the benefits of country-specific laws outweigh these. Laws that respect cultural differences and address local challenges more effectively serve the interests of individual nations and their citizens.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14852,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
